# patch.build.fkb: the steps ore-patch.fk and mixed-patch.fk need (EXAMPLES.md chapter 3): the
# terrain the surface names, then size and place. In a run the template's nauvis.build.fkb has
# the same steps (`read_terrain map`: name the fixture game\map.terrain.json, or change the line)
# and `fk build --to place` runs them.
read_surface    nauvis
read_terrain    patch
elaborate
size
place
